Project Title
  Bakery Shop Ingredients Inventory

Problem Statement
  Taking inventory of the ingredients in bakeshops with pen and paper is exhausting, sluggish, and susceptible to errors. With this program, the process becomes quick, easy, and accurate, saving time and energy.

Project Objectives
  The objective is to help students/workers to track and correctly remind them of bakery ingredients using online.

Planned Features
  1.Start the program
  2.Ask for required ingredients.
  3.Track the ammounts of ingredients left.
  4.Output the ammounts and remind the user what was left.
  

Planned Inputs and Outputs
  Inputs:
    yeast, sugar, water, butter, eggs, flour, milk, chocolate filling, vanilla filling, strawberry filling, salt

  Output:
    "All clear!"
    "WARNING! You have only 500 mL of water left."
    "WARNING! You have no eggs left."

Logic Plan
  The ideas started from pseudocode with the use of flowcharts.
